{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/07/25/2772458/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"22.23と大阪城ホールにてライブでした〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/07/25/2772458/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん暑い中来てくれて本当にありがとうございました。\n満席で上の方までびっしりと皆さんがいて、ステージから見えるサイリウムなどとっても綺麗で感動しました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/07/25/2772458/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"タオルや団扇なども見えましたよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/07/25/2772458/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大阪行くよ〜とか頑張って〜！ってコメント本当に嬉しいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/07/25/2772458/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/07/25/2772458/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回の全国ツアーは即完して全部満員で行うっていうのを聞いてメンバーやスタッフさん！\nみんなとっても嬉しかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/07/25/2772458/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回はキャプテンのれいかちゃんが参加出来なくて残念だったけど、早く良くなりますように(  ･᷄-･᷅ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/07/25/2772458/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/07/25/2772458/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ろってぃーとひなことゆったん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/07/25/2772458/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誕生日おめでとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/07/25/2772458/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなこはいつも元気いっぱいで見ていてかわいらしいな〜とまあやより年上だけどいい意味で年下に見えますよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/07/25/2772458/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/07/25/2772458/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆったん！\nゆったんはめっちゃアクティブだなーって思う！\nちょっとでも時間があれば近場のどっか国にいったりしててすごい！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/07/25/2772458/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆったんのピョンピョンしたダンスすきだよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/07/25/2772458/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かわいいっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ろってぃー！！！\n誕生日のとき連絡したようにまあやはほんとにろってぃーがいると元気になるしなんでも頑張るぞ！！！！って前向きになれるよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/07/25/2772458/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/07/25/2772458/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/07/25/2772458/0013.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"24はオフだったので"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/07/25/2772458/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高山一実"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/07/25/2772458/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"能條愛未"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/07/25/2772458/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"西野七瀬"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/07/25/2772458/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"斎藤ちはる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/07/25/2772458/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"和田まあや\nの5人でUSJに行ってきたよーーーー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/07/25/2772458/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学校やテストでなかなか参加出来なかったから\n行く事ができて すっごいすっごい楽しかった〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/07/25/2772458/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なぁちゃんは実家に泊まってまあやたちはとってもとっても素敵なホテルに泊まって遅くまでお話しして寝ました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/07/25/2772458/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絶叫苦手なんだけどみんなのテンション感にノッて沢山乗ったぁ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/07/25/2772458/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほぼほぼ全部のアトラクションに乗りました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/07/25/2772458/0017.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"満喫です〜♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大阪公演とユニバに、もう１つ！アンダーライブが広島、倉敷、山口に決定しました〜(^o^)実は私の地元からは倉敷の方が近いのでよく行ってました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まさか倉敷でもライブができるなんて！凄く嬉しいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"是非来て下さい〜‼待ってます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんなに幸せで大丈夫なのかな？って思ったぐらい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/07/25/2772458/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しい時間が続いています"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなのおかげです。ありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/07/25/2772458/0019.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/07/25/2772458/0020.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"帰りはなぁちゃんパパが駅まで車で送ってくださいました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/07/25/2772458/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なぁちゃんパパはとっても優しくて、昔握手会の時とか楽屋に私達のためにミルクせんべいを作ってくださったりしていつも美味しく頂いてました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/07/25/2772458/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/07/25/2772458/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂工事中のシークレットグラフィティーの歌収録はテストで参加できませんした。涙まあやが居なかったよ〜って気づいてくれてありがとう〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/07/25/2772458/0021.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も朝からお仕事頑張ってるよ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/07/25/2772458/0019.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみにNHKにてRの法則生放送だよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/07/25/2772458/0022.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/07/25/2772458/0023.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みてねーーーー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/07/25/2772458/0019.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/07/25/2772458/0024.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/07/25/2772458/0024.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}